## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of multi-tenant data routing, per-tenant retention, and end-to-end tracing in a beginner-friendly AWS DVA task.

## Key Concepts
- Kinesis Data Streams, Lambda, S3 partitioning
- Per-tenant routing and object tagging for retention
- Schema validation, basic scoring, DLQ handling
- Idempotent writes, deduplication, X-Ray tracing
- Backfill strategy and LocalStack validation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: normalization function sketch
function normalize(event){
  if(!event.tenantId || !event.deviceId || !event.ts) throw new Error('Invalid');
  // normalize schema, coerce types, add required fields
  return {
    tenantId: String(event.tenantId),
    deviceId: String(event.deviceId),
    ts: Number(event.ts),
    payload: event.payload || {}
  };
}
```

